  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your flashing blades distract your target and leave him open to deadly countermoves.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Improved Two-Weapon FeintUC.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use this feat, you can forgo your first (highest base attack bonus) attack with either your primary hand or your off hand in order to make a Bluff check to feint.</p>\n<p>If the Bluff check succeeds, your target is denied its Dexterity bonus to AC against you until the end of your turn. If you forgo your first (highest base attack bonus) attack with both your primary hand and your off hand and both Bluff checks to feint succeed, your target is denied its Dexterity bonus until the beginning of your next turn against attacks by you and any one ally you choose that also threatens the target.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc187\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
